---
description: Project context and guardrails
alwaysApply: true
---

- The app is the Vite + React frontend in `frontend/`. Follow `frontend/AGENTS.md` and `frontend/DESIGN-HANDOFF.md`.
- Do not change the protected login, wallet, approval, payment or pricing files listed in `frontend/design/protected-files.json` without review.
- Never hardcode keys; public config comes from `VITE_*` env variables.
- Test USDC on Arc testnet only; the UI must keep showing "Demo — no real money".
- Crypto stays invisible in the UI: show dollars, never raw addresses or gas.
